  <description akvo:type="5" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hofokam Ltd is seeking &#x20ac; 30,000 for technical assistance&#xa0; to cover the following elements:
Training of branch WASH champions, Credit team, and select senior management on WASH Lending in the Micro Credit space by a WASH expert.
Hofokam WASH loan product review and re-design to meet the client&apos;s needs
Undertake marketing and promotion of the WASH loan product through activations and online advertisements
Support Hofokam Ltd to attend stakeholder engagement meetings within Uganda and promote the WASH loan brand partnership with Aqua For All/OikoCredit</narrative>
  </description>
